# The shared staff body. Every person is a palette swap of this sprite.
#
# Roles a variant may touch:
#   n N  hair (body, light)        f F  skin (body, shade)
#   z Z  shirt (body, shade)       ^ &  trousers (body, shade)
#   3 W  shoes (body, shine)
#   X    glasses: drawn in skin fair, so invisible. X=5 or X=M puts frames on.
#   x    beard: drawn in skin fair shade, so it reads as the chin. x=<hair> grows one.
# A person with a darker skin pair also moves X and x to that skin: X=d x=D.
#
# To hire: copy a line, change the swaps, compile, check out/staff.png.
# Long hair or a skirt lives on staff-b (same frame names, same roles).
sprite staff
size 16 32
layer character
footprint 1 1
origin 0 16
fps 4
tag staff
# Marshall, Office Manager: silver hair, charcoal jacket, slate trousers, glasses.
variant marshall n=M N=m z=5 Z=K ^=K &=k X=5
# Ada: black hair, tan skin, rust blouse, navy trousers.
variant ada n=i N=I f=d F=D X=d x=D z=R Z=8
# Theo: black hair and beard, deep skin, sage shirt, walnut trousers.
variant theo n=i N=I f=b F=B X=b x=i z=S Z=0 ^=W &=3
# Juno: amber hair, teal top, charcoal trousers, glasses.
variant juno n=Y N=y z=T Z=6 ^=5 &=K X=M

